  "id": "dual-thresholds",
  "term": "dual thresholds",
  "definition": "Dual thresholds are two cutoff points used together to judge whether an action is economically worthwhile. In this source, they are the paired limits for deployment cost and operational cost that are used to compare when different parties would be willing or unwilling to implement blockchain.",
